Derived material
----------------

The following files contain material copied from or adapted from
alibaba/open-code-review, and carry notices stating that they were changed:

  skills/open-code-review/SKILL.md
      Ported from plugins/open-code-review/skills/open-code-review-delegate/SKILL.md.
      Changed for DeepSeek Harness: the `ocr delegate preview` and
      `ocr delegate rule` subcommands are reached through the
      `ocr_review_scope` and `ocr_review_rules` tools instead of a shell, and
      the diff-reading and reporting steps are rewritten for DSH's tool surface.

  lib/ocr.js, lib/index.js
      The command-line contract — subcommand and flag names, the paired-ref and
      mutually-exclusive argument rules, the 10 MiB output ceiling, the
      process-group kill on timeout, and the delegation JSON schema — follows
      plugins/open-code-review/opencode/open-code-review.ts and
      cmd/opencodereview/delegate_cmd.go. The implementation is new JavaScript
      with no code copied, but the interface it implements is theirs.

Not derived
-----------

This package does not contain or redistribute the Open Code Review binary. It
locates and executes an `ocr` installation that the user installs separately:

  npm install -g @alibaba-group/open-code-review

